      "reason": "The Data Analysis section describes data preparation methods including the Freeman-Tukey double arcsine transformation for proportions, pooling dichotomous data as odds ratios, classification of babies into mutually exclusive transmission categories (with modifications to WHO criteria), and a detailed deduplication process with author contact for missing/unpublished information (text_16: 'A detailed deduplication process was used... We contacted study authors for unpublished information')."
